ets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TKO 2023 Q4","e":"tko","d":"2024-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Shapiro","x":"So anytime there was back-to-back shows that were even in the same region, there was substantial cost savings, truck, personnel, satellite time, you name it.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TKO 2023 Q4","e":"tko","d":"2024-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Schleimer","x":"So sun-setting that network is certainly a part of our plan and will yield cost savings when we transfer over to the licensed model, as I said in my prepared remarks.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TKO 2024 Q2","e":"tko","d":"2024-08-09","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mark Shapiro","x":"We're strong in attracting viewers and subs in this whole direct-to-consumer environment we're in.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TKO 2024 Q2","e":"tko","d":"2024-08-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Schleimer","x":"The decrease in expenses reflected lower personnel costs and other direct costs related to our planned cost reduction initiatives implemented following the formation of TKO, as well as a decrease in production costs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TKO 2024 Q2","e":"tko","d":"2024-08-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Schleimer","x":"On the production side, we have been successful at taking cost out of the business on production and this has simply been blocking and tackling.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TKO 2024 Q2","e":"tko","d":"2024-08-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Andrew Schleimer","x":"Regarding free cash flow conversion, we are reaffirming our outlook at an excess of 40% of adjusted EBITDA for the full year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TKO 2024 Q3","e":"tko","d":"2024-11-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mark Shapiro","x":"And streaming is on fire, and new platforms and fast channels are coming all the time.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TKO 2024 Q3","e":"tko","d":"2024-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Schleimer","x":"The decrease in expenses primarily reflected lower personnel costs and production costs related to our planned cost reduction initiatives implemented following the formation of TKO.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TKO 2024 Q3","e":"tko","d":"2024-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Shapiro","x":"So almost like for like from an event calendar perspective on WWE, but what I think you're seeing here is just the continued cost savings measures and initiatives that we set out to put in place when we launched TKO really inflowing through us just being more efficient top to bottom.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TKO 2024 Q4","e":"tko","d":"2025-02-26","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Ari Emanuel","x":"For starters, moving Raw, our premier WWE franchise, to Netflix will put us in front of the streamers, 300 million subscribers, week in and week out, and serve to be transformative to our business.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TKO 2024 Q4","e":"tko","d":"2025-02-26","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mark Shapiro","x":"Obviously, these are appealing attributes for buyers of content, particularly with the streaming services, which is what it's all about these days.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TKO 2024 Q4","e":"tko","d":"2025-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Schleimer","x":"The decrease in expenses primarily reflected lower personnel and production costs related to our planned cost reduction initiatives implemented following our formation.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TKO 2024 Q4","e":"tko","d":"2025-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Schleimer","x":"The decrease was primarily due to savings from our cost reduction program.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TKO 2025 Q1","e":"tko","d":"2025-05-08","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Ari Emanuel","x":"At WWE, the year started with the spectacle debut of our Netflix partnership, which will put our content in front of the streamer's 300 million global subscribers each week.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TKO 2025 Q1","e":"tko","d":"2025-05-08","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Andrew Schleimer","x":"As for tariffs, we are largely insulated as the vast majority of our revenue is not expected to be directly impacted.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TKO 2025 Q1","e":"tko","d":"2025-05-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Schleimer","x":"When we announced the deal last October, we presented an expected full-year 2025 revenue and adjusted EBITDA contribution from these acquired businesses, inclusive of expected run-rate cost savings, of approximately $1.555 billion and $165 million, respectively.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TKO 2025 Q1","e":"tko","d":"2025-05-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Schleimer","x":"Number two, our prior cost savings and transaction impacts target of $30 million plus.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TKO 2025 Q1","e":"tko","d":"2025-05-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ari Emanuel","x":"Our first quarter revenue and profitability beat our internal expectations, and as a result, we are raising our guidance for the full year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TKO 2025 Q1","e":"tko","d":"2025-05-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark Shapiro","x":"So another good sign for the business, another reason why we're bullish about our forecast and raising guidance.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TKO 2025 Q3","e":"tko","d":"2025-11-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Ariel Zev Emanuel","x":"WWE's five-year premium live events partnership with ESPN in the U.S. launched ahead of schedule in Q3 with the first-ever Wrestle Palooza, a new franchise streamed exclusively on ESPN's new direct-to-consumer service.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/tko-group-tko-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKO 2025 Q3","e":"tko","d":"2025-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew M. Schleimer","x":"SG&A decreased primarily due to lower Olympics-related costs at On Location, as well as the impact of cost reduction initiatives in connection with the acquisition of IMG and On Location.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/tko-group-tko-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKO 2025 Q3","e":"tko","d":"2025-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ariel Zev Emanuel","x":"These achievements, paired with strong quarterly results and the increased full-year guidance we announced today, underscore our continued momentum in the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/tko-group-tko-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKO 2026 Q1","e":"tko","d":"2026-05-06","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Mark Shapiro","x":"Our live events box office business has continued momentum and as such, our financial incentive packages pipeline is growing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/tko-tko-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TKO 2026